{"id": "EUVD-2026-101232", "enisaUuid": "4ade7711-4057-304a-bc09-0eecc0ff0116", "description": "Mini-XML 4.0.0 through 4.0.6 contains an off-by-one stack out-of-bounds write in mxml_strtod() when the locale decimal point is not '.'. Attackers can supply XML with a 63-digit REAL value followed by '.' to write a NUL byte past the 64-byte stack buffer, corrupting stack memory or crashing the process.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:16:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:19:42", "baseScore": 2.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/mxml-strtod-locale-stack-overflow", "https://github.com/michaelrsweet/mxml/blob/v4.0.6/mxml-file.c#L1860-L1887", "https://github.com/michaelrsweet/mxml/commit/367c7ddd3387f65e867d776216de274bcaa3dae1", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mini-xml-4.0.0-through-4.0.6-stack-out-of-bounds-write-via-mxml-strtod"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pc2v-ppxx-vfq5", "CVE-2026-110604"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0d9d169e-adab-3953-83cd-2cb22dff672c", "product": {"name": "Mini-XML", "vendor": {"name": "Michael R Sweet"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 \u22644.0.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ed3da410-495e-3d7c-b320-686d7a1897f2", "vendor": {"name": "Michael R Sweet"}}], "isExploited": false}